"""MapleStory Classic World: names of the items a player picks up, for matching OCR'd pickup messages.

Source: meowdb.com's item database (https://meowdb.com/msclassic/item-db), a fan database, fetched 2026-10-18:
every Etc, Use and Equip item it lists with its Orbis / Ossyria / El Nath content hidden, which leaves Victoria
Island's: monster drops, quest items, potions, scrolls, and equipment for levels 0 to 70. The lists behind its
pages: https://meowdb.com/msclassic/api/items?type=Etc&ossyria=0&page=1&limit=100 (likewise Use and Equip).
Items with no known source there are kept: its drop data is community-sourced and incomplete.

Checked by item ID against the names in the game's own data files (String.wz), 2026-10-18: they're the same,
except that meowdb tells apart items sharing a name with a suffix the game doesn't show ("Red Potion (Alt)",
"Dark Marble (Warrior)"). Such items are listed under the game's name.
311 Etc, 388 Use and 1177 Equip names, 1875 in all.
"""

